# CQ1 — Which companies are mentioned in a given document?

PREFIX fin: <https://froilan-sia.github.io/finance-ontology-rag/ontology#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>

SELECT ?companyName
WHERE {
    ?document a fin:Document ;
              fin:mentionsCompany ?company .
    ?company fin:hasName ?companyName .
}
ORDER BY ?companyName
